      "id": 63486,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-21T15:10:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fear not! The pre-order will be announced here on our website, as well as on our Twitter account (@GTGamesLLC) once it begins. We anticipate starting pre-orders some time in July, and running them for at least a couple of weeks. Furthermore, there will not be a limited number of pre-orders; pre-orders will be possible for a pre-announced window of time, and anyone ordering Vengeance during that window will get in on the pre-order.</p>",
