      "created_at": "2013-05-22T16:51:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@<a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/silverleaf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Silverleaf</a></p><p>The advantage of pre-ordering is that everyone who pre-orders will get the America's Greatest Legacy promo card and Oversized Villain Cards for free with their order. Pre-orders will also be sent out before Vengeance is sent to distributors (but after it is sent to backers from the Shattered Timelines Kickstarter campaign).</p>",
